    "title": "Who does USA play in 2026 WBC final after defeating Dominican Republic?",
    "text": "Updated March 15, 2026, 11:41 p.m. ETTeam USA will play for a world championship.The United States defeated the Dominican Republic, 2-1, in a thrilling 2026 World Baseball Classic semifinal game Sunday night.Solo home runs by Gunnar Henderson and Roman Anthony in the fourth inning gave the United States a 2-1 lead after Junior Caminero's second-inning homer put the Dominican Republic ahead, 1-0.In the fifth inning, Aaron Judge was robbed of a potential home run by Julio Rodriguez's sensational catch at the centerfield wall.USA reliever Mason Miller closed it out with a drama-filled ninth inning that ended with a questionable game-ending third-strike call, sending the United States to the championship game.Here's what you need to know on how to watch, stream and more on the WBC final:Who does Team USA play in World Baseball Classic final?The United States plays the winner of Monday night's semifinal game between Italy and Venezuela in the 2026 World Baseball Classic final. Team USA lost to Italy, 8-6, in pool play.Shop 2026 WBC final ticketsWhen is the 2026 World Baseball Classic final?Date: Tuesday, March 17Time: 8 p.m.What channel is 2026 World Baseball Classic final?TV channel: FOXHow to stream 2026 World Baseball Classic finalStreaming:FuboStream 2026 World Baseball Classic live on FuboTeam USA schedule, results in World Baseball Classic 2026Here's Team USA's pool play schedule and results so far in this year's World Baseball Classic:USA 15, Brazil 5, Pool BUSA 9, Great Britain 1, Pool BUSA 5, Mexico 3, Pool BItaly 8, USA 6, Pool BQuarterfinals: USA 5, Canada 3Semifinals: USA 2, Dominican Republic 1Final: USA vs. Venezuela/Italy, Tuesday, March 17Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
